# Tidy URLs: /about serves about.html as a rewrite (status 200). Since v15 the
# extensionless form is the canonical one -- rel=canonical, og:url, the JSON-LD
# @id/url pairs, the sitemap and every internal link all use /about, so the two
# URLs are consolidated on the pretty form. The .html paths still resolve for
# old inbound links; do not add a forced 301 from .html -> pretty without
# testing it on a deploy preview first (rewrite + forced redirect can loop).
/about           /about.html            200
/skills          /skills.html           200
/experience      /experience.html       200
/research        /research.html         200
/projects        /projects.html         200
/certifications  /certifications.html   200
/community       /community.html        200
/contact         /contact.html          200
/contact-success /contact-success.html  200
